  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nGiven expression: 13 - 25 = 5 + 4 ÷ 12\n\n1. + and =\n\n__**13**__ - 25 __**+ 5**__ = __**4 ÷ 12**__\n\n⇒ 18 - 25 = 0.33\n\n⇒ -7 ≠ 0.33\n\n2. - and =\n\n13 = 25 - 5 + __**4 ÷ 12**__\n\n⇒ 13 = __**25**__ - 5 __**+ 0.33**__\n\n⇒ 13 = __**25.33 - 5**__\n\n⇒ 13 ≠ 20.33\n\n3. + and -\n\n__**13 + 25**__ = 5 - __**4 ÷ 12**__\n\n⇒ 38 = __**5 - 0.33**__\n\n⇒ 38 ≠ 4.67\n\n4. ÷ and =\n\n13 - __**25 ÷ 5 **__+ 4 = 12\n\n⇒ __**13**__ - 5 __**+ 4**__ = 12\n\n⇒ 17 - 5 = 12\n\n⇒ 12 = 12 \n\nHence, the correct answer is '**÷ and =**'.",
